ros-jazzy-rawlog2rosbag (4.2.0-1noble) noble; urgency=high

  * New CLI tool: rawlog2rosbag, to convert MRPT rawlog datasets into ROS 2 bags (mcap or sqlite3), with sensor poses as /tf_static and optional TUM ground truth trajectory
